        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "Sets the default color and font for every heading on the site (page titles, section titles, card/item titles, sub-headings). Individual sections still have their own heading color and font pickers — leave those blank to use the value set here, or pick a value there to override it just on that page. The footer and homepage hero headline have their own dedicated colors and are not affected by this panel."
      },
